 5 C44 6 52.5 15 53.5 27.5 C53.5 27.5 43.5 31 32 32 Z"></path><path transform="rotate(90 32 32)" d="M32 32 L32 5 C44 6 52.5 15 53.5 27.5 C53.5 27.5 43.5 31 32 32 Z"></path><path transform="rotate(180 32 32)" d="M32 32 L32 5 C44 6 52.5 15 53.5 27.5 C53.5 27.5 43.5 31 32 32 Z"></path><path transform="rotate(270 32 32)" d="M32 32 L32 5 C44 6 52.5 15 53.5 27.5 C53.5 27.5 43.5 31 32 32 Z"></path></g><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="3.4" fill="#176aa8"></circle></svg><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><h4 class="text-body-lg font-bold leading-tight">Adventure for all</h4><p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Our world class attractions are designed for all ages, young and old.</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-4"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 mt-0.5 size-9" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><defs><linearGradient id="ninjaStarGradient" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#5fd4ea"></stop><stop offset="55%" stop-color="#25a8e0"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#176aa8"></stop></linearGradient></defs><g fill="url(#ninjaStarGradient)"><path transform="rotate(0 32 32)" d="M32 32 L32 5 C44 6 52.5 15 53.5 27.5 C53.5 27.5 43.5 31 32 32 Z"></path><path transform="rotate(90 32 32)" d="M32 32 L32 5 C44 6 52.5 15 53.5 27.5 C53.5 27.5 43.5 31 32 32 Z"></path><path transform="rotate(180 32 32)" d="M32 32 L32 5 C44 6 52.5 15 53.5 27.5 C53.5 27.5 43.5 31 32 32 Z"></path><path transform="rotate(270 32 32)" d="M32 32 L32 5 C44 6 52.5 15 53.5 27.5 C53.5 27.5 43.5 31 32 32 Z"></path></g><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="3.4" fill="#176aa8"></circle></svg><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><h4 class="text-body-lg font-bold leading-tight">Rise to the Challenge</h4><p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Each visit brings a fun and exciting obstacle for your ninja to tackle.</p></div></li><li class="flex items-start gap-4"><svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" role="img" aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 mt-0.5 size-9" xmln